{"explanation":"This shows a scatter plot with the least-squares line of best fit. Drag any yellow point and the line refits right away, using slope = Σ(x−x̄)(y−ȳ) / Σ(x−x̄)². The line always passes through the mean point (x̄, ȳ), which is drawn in red.","manimCode":"const axes = new Axes({ xRange: [0, 10, 1], yRange: [0, 8, 1], xLength: 10, yLength: 6, tips: false });
axes.moveTo([0, -0.2, 0]);
